msgstr ""

msgid ""
"There are various optional properties useful to refine your session factory "
"or guide Quarkus' guesses."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When no properties are set, Quarkus can typically infer everything it needs "
"to set up Hibernate Reactive\n"
"and will have it use the default datasource."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The configuration properties listed here allow you to override such "
"defaults, and customize and tune various aspects."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Hibernate Reactive uses the same properties you would use for Hibernate ORM: "
"see <<configuration-reference>>."
msgstr ""

