msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The use of `@io.quarkus.test.vertx.RunOnVertxContext` or `@io.quarkus.test."
"TestReactiveTransaction` on the test methods"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The use of `io.quarkus.test.vertx.UniAsserter` as a test method parameter."
